        "subject": "LU-20232 dkms: restore dkms-debs target",
        "message": "LU-20232 dkms: restore dkms-debs target\n\nUpdate debian/rules to deal with the removal of autoMakefiles\n\nRun a full install to a temporary location and extract the\ndesired header files since a targeted install of Lustre and LNet\nheader files it not possible.\n\nDrop dependancy on 'ed' tool, use 'sed' instead.\n\nForward \"int_o2ib\" to DEB_BUILD_PROFILES to ensure the\nlnet/klnds/in-kernel-o2iblnd content is populated.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testgroup=full-dkms\nFixes: 8cf1563a7c (\"LU-18876 build: remove Lustre header autoMakefiles\")\nFixes: 4ff30bece1 (\"LU-18687 build: refactor the top-level Makefile\")\nSigned-off-by: Shaun Tancheff <shaun.tancheff@hpe.com>\nChange-Id: Ie10e1eb1b11facd396dddd94547ed98376fe90cd\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/65759\nReviewed-by: James Simmons <jsimmons@infradead.org>\nReviewed-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
